question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+0y+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-1051" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-1051" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & -3 & -15\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\begin{aligned}-5x-y=10 \\\\ -3x-2y=-5\\end{aligned}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=1 \\\\ -2x-3y=-5\\end{aligned}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Co