question" "q-71733" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -3\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71733" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71733" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-1070" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{2}+4{x}_{1}=3{x}_{3} \\\\ -11{x}_{3}=12\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-1070" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}-11{x}_{3}=12\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a48919c3815ae63440e108e5108ed3db5e61050b64a8a98b9ec9ad3b7" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-1070" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf" "basis" 1304 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-1070" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "2de3fc6a4