demy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129122" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "32086a5dcc39d126933b1e3533d3a1949134bd79a3b9ca47faef090ddd2f7219"} {"question" "q-129122" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129122" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 8\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & -7 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & -7\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 1 & -7\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 8 & -7 & 0\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129122" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & -7\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-1051" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-1051" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+0y+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-1051" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "32086a5dcc39d126933b1e3533d3a1949134bd79a3b9ca47faef090ddd2f7219"} {"question" "q-1051" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-1051" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned