{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129124" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "32086a5dcc39d126933b1e3533d3a1949134bd79a3b9ca47faef090ddd2f7219"} {"question" "q-129124" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129124" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -9 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 9 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -9 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 9 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -9 & -1\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129124" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -9 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71722" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-3=2y \\\\ 1+y=-2x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71722" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=3 \\\\ 2x+y=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71722" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "32086a5dcc39d126933b1e3533d3a1949134bd79a3b9ca47faef090ddd2f7219"} {"question" "q-71722" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71722" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71722" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129133" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & -8 & 4 & -\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 0 & 5 & \\frac{2}{3} & 8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{3} & 4 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129133" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 0x+5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129133" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "32086a5dcc39d126933b1e3533d3a1949134bd79a3b9ca47faef090ddd2f7219"} {"question" "q-129133" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129133" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\begin{aligned}-8x+4y=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5x+\\frac{2}{3}y=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}-8x+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5x+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=-8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=-6\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ x+5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129133" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71723" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71723" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71723" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "32086a5dcc39d126933b1e3533d3a1949134bd79a3b9ca47faef090ddd2f7219"} {"question" "q-71723" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71723" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-4z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=1 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=2\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+y+2z=1\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ x+y+z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-71723" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129129" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 1 & -9\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129129" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x+8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129129" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "32086a5dcc39d126933b1e3533d3a1949134bd79a3b9ca47faef090ddd2f7219"} {"question" "q-129129" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129129" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\begin{aligned}8x+y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ x+4y=-9\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ x+4y=9\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x+8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=9\\end{aligned}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-129129" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9\\end{aligned}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-20367" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 & 1 & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4} & 0 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 3 & \\frac{1}{2} & 6 & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-20367" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x-0y+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/state.json" "file_sha256" "054a6c038b390b1facb7135906c6e18cc234c242006d9460d6915ece60d4beab"} {"question" "q-20367" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "32086a5dcc39d126933b1e3533d3a1949134bd79a3b9ca47faef090ddd2f7219"} {"question" "q-20367" "field" "selection" "attribute" 