](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/e0318c549ab4aa25bf2decb41e45e296406d699706c03aff7ea44724d20edece.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & -2 \\\n\t\t0 & 2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/example-4683.json" "file_sha256" "cea8cc93e8d5cdb0c1d3c715d3eb022e7112108c29b02fc124df2a9fc17f7eda"} {"question" "e-4684" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/a5abba041a61cad76d43d5bb13d0fd4e873eb2daf2282e8d9828b8ab79fe2ba0.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/example-4684.json" "file_sha256" "82c180c2e175b627ea100092ea9e2fa553077a3cde6b4c2fedd4db95d21d4177"} {"question" "e-4684" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/2f9ae37920ec528a700715658900bbbf3ec4c855767bf06f79d044f488a8bbf2.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3 \\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1 \\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/af1499610c0c312a1f5c50d99967a004ae6b3042c3a88ca20a86f922b28aaaff.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/example-4684.json" "file_sha256" "82c180c2e175b627ea100092ea9e2fa553077a3cde6b4c2fedd4db95d21d4177"} {"question" "e-4685" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/4d90e81043121495ae8bb7742400b2c9e705cb7d706f553a6ab2aec44b35d017.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/example-4685.json" "file_sha256" "5459ca805169e1ff451861ee46d985cf2d619e8f9582d53167dab2c52286b2d5"} {"question" "e-4685" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/3e7f783023405be3ea79a740998fefac3a6ea909e9903f5ea300a9234ae63003.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/example-4685.json" "file_sha256" "5459ca805169e1ff451861ee46d985cf2d619e8f9582d53167dab2c52286b2d5"} {"question" "e-4686" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/d89417b7eb2d000bbd81fcf4a89ca7eaa5529fc56d9b41bf6e8bb237d2eb9e16.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/example-4686.json" "file_sha256" "ebb6c3d0a73f688310497707d130bfa6263680ea74afafd37aa7017afa07f68f"} {"question" "e-4686" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/93874fa93cfd9ef3df1492bbc35056c2381157740d8ca26b475474faf54ee4d1.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/8356d9148bc06d76a5aee41e4a07651c43d94b2496d9542eb8b6e01ee52ea161.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/example-4686.json" "file_sha256" "ebb6c3d0a73f688310497707d130bfa6263680ea74afafd37aa7017afa07f68f"}] "usage" {"q-71713" [] "q-71728" [] "q-71733" [] "e-4685" [] "q-71722" [] "e-4686" [] "q-1051" [] "q-1052" [] "e-4684" [] "q-1070" [] "e-4683" []} "basis" 2546 "retractions" [[17592186060321 :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${-x + y = 2; x - y =-2$"] [17592186059500 :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=1 \\\\ 2y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186059500 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-2y=1 \\\\ 0x+2y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & -2 \\\n\t\t0 & 2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$"] [17592186059501 :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}y+x-5-3z=0 \\\\ z=y+7x \\\\ y+3-2z=1-2x\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186059501 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+y-3z=5 \\\\ -7x-y+z=0 \\\\ 2x+y-2z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3 \\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1 \\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186059502 :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5 & -4 & -12 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186059502 :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x-4y=-12 \\\\ 3x+y=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186059503 :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{c}{2}=a \\\\ 5+3b-a=4c \\\\ d=1\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186059503 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-a+0b+\\frac{1}{2}c+0d=0 \\\\ -a+3b-4c+0d=-5 \\\\ 0a+0b+0c+d=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186056085 17592186056086 17592186056087 17592186056088 17592186056089 17592186058910 17592186058911 17592186058912 17592186058913 17592186058914 17592186298993 17592186298994 17592186298995 17592186298996 17592186298997 17592186299007 17592186299008 17592186299009 17592186299010 17592186299011 17592186299091 17592186299092 17592186299093 17592186299094 17592186299095 17592186299098 17592186299099 17592186299100 17592186299101 17592186299102 17592186299105 17592186299106 17592186299107 17592186299108 17592186299109] "immutable_fields" [[17592186056084 :answer-field/correct] [17592186056084 :answer-field/id] [17592186056084 :answer-field/key] [17592186056084 :answer-field/type] [17592186058909 :answer-field/correct] [17592186058909 :answer-field/id] [17592186058909 :answer-field/key] [17592186058909 :answer-field/type] [17592186298992 :answer-field/correct] [17592186298992 :answer-field/id] [17592186298992 :answer-field/key] [17592186298992 :answer-field/type] [17592186299006 :answer-field/correct] [17592186299006 :answer-field/id] [17592186299006 :answer-field/key] [17592186299006 :answer-field/type] [17592186299090 :answer-field/correct] [17592186299090 :answer-field/id] [17592186299090 :answer-field/key] [17592186299090 :answer-field/type] [17592186299097 :answer-field/correct] [17592186299097 :answer-field/id] [17592186299097 :answer-field/key] [17592186299